    "detailed_description": "It's a car racing maze game with progressive difficulty levels, that starts from very easy to more complex.<br />\r\nYou are alone in the game. it's a single player game. But with the option to save multiple user profiles.<br />\r\nThe ambiance in the game is calm and relaxing &quot;check the music in the video&quot;, with a modern outdoor architecture style.<br />\r\nAs the name indicates you should play the levels many times to get better record times.<br />\r\nIt's a 52 level racing game to find the checkpoints and do the needed laps to the finish line. Good luck!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*August 2023 Update - Added audio sound FX",
